  "howToPlay": "How to Play",
  "howToPlayIntro": "Number Gravity is a puzzle where numbered tiles attract and repel each other. Plan your moves, let gravity settle, and reach the goal in as few moves as possible.",
  "howToPlayGoalTitle": "Reach the goal",
  "howToPlayGoalBody": "Every level has an objective — usually landing a tile on the golden star. Read the level goal, then plan a path through the grid.",
  "howToPlayPullTitle": "Blue tiles pull",
  "howToPlayPullBody": "Positive numbers attract nearby tiles. A +3 tile pulls others toward it. Use attraction to steer tiles where you need them.",
  "howToPlayPushTitle": "Red tiles push",
  "howToPlayPushBody": "Negative numbers repel nearby tiles. A −2 tile pushes others away. Combine push and pull to solve tricky layouts.",
  "howToPlaySwipeTitle": "Swipe to move",
  "howToPlaySwipeBody": "Tap a tile to select it, then swipe up, down, left, or right to move it one cell. You can also swipe without selecting — the main tile moves.",
  "howToPlayGravityTitle": "Gravity settles automatically",
  "howToPlayGravityBody": "After each move, gravity runs until the board is stable. Tiles keep sliding based on forces until nothing moves. Watch the chain reaction before your next turn.",
  "howToPlayStarsTitle": "Earn stars",
  "howToPlayStarsBody": "Finish in the minimum moves for 3 stars. Up to two extra moves still earns 2 stars. Fewer moves mean more coins and better rankings.",
  "howToPlayControlsTitle": "Undo & Hint",
  "howToPlayControlsBody": "Made a mistake? Tap Undo to rewind one move. Stuck? Use Hint to see a suggested direction. Hints are limited — use them wisely.",
